      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Found out this is a UDON based issue. This world has a script that uses network to teleport player who got disconnected back where they were once they rejoin.\n\nFor some reason, this is no longer working with the most recent vrchat version, creating the error above.\n\nI will update the world with a fix, but kept the UDON files if worth looking at for the dev team.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-10-17T15:42:43.064Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "1. Open an instance of this world on PC, and keep the PC player inside it: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f018b93a-8898-4058-aaee-dc26338f5eaf/info\n\n2. Attempt joining that same instance on native Quest\n\n3. Observe being either denied for being \"incompatible with the latest world version\" or, in some cases, let in but completely unable to move or open menus, being forced to hard-quit VRChat.\n\nAttempted already:\n\n- updating the world to latest SDK + third party packages in VCC, on a different ID here: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6f60dfe2-10f8-4e63-bb83-5563c97af755/info",
